edicated equipment-intensive, and heavily reliant on the experience of the researcher [ 50 ,  51 ]. This approach’s inherent inefficiencies slow the timely discovery and optimization of new HEA compositions. Researchers urgently need to find a method that breaks the limitations of the traditional strategy and efficiently and rapidly discovers high-quality HEAs with satisfactory multiple properties [ 52 ].

